{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790543460, "covers_from": "2026-09-27T21:11:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-27T21:12:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790543520, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-27T21:11:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "queue_number": 52668, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "輪椅人會因為各種原因無法順利搭乘公車；復康巴士預約不易；無障礙計程車費用負擔大", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.52,668", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T21:11:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 20019, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "腳踏車比行人兇行人比汽車兇。腳踏車跟不知名輪車在人行道任意狂飆、行人不看路就是衝，要汽車禮讓他", "display_name": "大安代表 No.20,019", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T21:11:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4409, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我希望台北可以有逐步減少摩托車的政策。台北的交通便利性已經可以向這方向前進。這才是國際化都市像貌。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.4,409", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T21:11:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 25708, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "觀光", "content": "臺北燈節、大稻埕煙火等活動都是單一地點、短期，只有點沒有面，應以兩點、長期創造價值！by年輕導遊領隊", "display_name": "大同代表 Andy Yang（楊宸安）", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 20019, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.20,019", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 4409, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.4,409", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 25708, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 Andy Yang（楊宸安）", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 10266, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "display_name